# Disgusting Oozeling from the Oozing Bags that oozes drop.
# Sources: the TDB's loot (Classic drop data): the Oozing Bag drops from the
# Vile Slimes and Devouring Oozes of Western Plaguelands 3.5%, the Large Vile
# Slime 4.8%, the Living Decay and Rotting Sludge of Eastern Plaguelands 3%,
# Felwood's Tainted Ooze 2.5% and Vile Ooze 1.5% (the rare The Ongar 10.5%),
# Un'Goro's oozes 1-2%; the bag holds the Disgusting Oozeling 1.9% of the time,
# otherwise potions, herbs, gems or a rare pattern. items.json's per-kill
# figures (0.02-0.24%) are these two chances multiplied. npcs.json (the ooze
# field in eastern Western Plaguelands: 12 Vile Slimes, 9 Devouring Oozes, a
# Large Vile Slime). Forever client 1.60.1.70532 (bag and pet can be traded).

step Oozes
  tip Oozes drop the Oozing Bag about once in 20-30 kills; the best are the Vile Slimes, Devouring Oozes and the Large Vile Slime in the ooze field of eastern Western Plaguelands (level 54-57). Open every bag: most hold potions or herbs, and only about one bag in 50 holds the Disgusting Oozeling, so expect over a thousand kills. Both the bags and the pet can be traded: unopened bags on the Auction House are lottery tickets, the pet itself the sure buy.
  collect 20769 "Disgusting Oozeling" @64.9,38.7 -- Open your Oozing Bags
